/*
  CostHeatmap.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0100 · CostHeatmap (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `CostHeatmap` resolves (table "CostHeatmap") lives here with its web value. These
  entries fold into the app `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration
  time; they are kept in a per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns
  its own strings without editing the shared catalog.

  The first group is the exact keys + values extracted from the web source
  (features/charging/components/charging-list/CostHeatmap.tsx), verified against
  web/src/i18n/en.json (charging.optimizer.*). The second group backs the
  native-only chrome (accessibility summary, freshness banners, loading / error).
*/

